      <p>SDR training may not be the first move when the company has no defined offer, the target market is wrong, the list is unusable, the buyer cannot be reached, the SDR has no time to prospect, nobody can take meetings, or the entire revenue process lacks ownership.</p>
      <p>In those cases, CallTeam may recommend <a href="/ai-lead-generation-services/">AI Lead Generation</a>, <a href="/services/outsourced-sdr/">Outsourced SDR Services</a>, or the <a href="/90-day-revenue-engine/">90-Day Revenue Engine</a> instead.</p>
